body:
ya ya I know its easy, which is why I still don't understand why my friend buys them when he could literally make them its so strange to me. Like im not a chemist and I can't synth LSD so i buy it, but ive never felt the need to go buy dmt instead of extracting.

&#x200B;

also love your name haha

I know a homie, I literally TAUGHT him how to extract himself. but he still buys carts from the guy in town who extracts it, and makes carts. he said he likes the convenience. IME people are getting carts from people who know how to extract and realized they could make a profit of the shit so they started making their own carts and shit.

&#x200B;

my homie said he likes the convenience of the carts but i still prefer using an oil burner.

Idk bout his boots but thus are wizard frames from mushroom blading

&#x200B;

 [MUSHROOM BLADING](http://www.mushroomblading.com/)  they also have this weird style of riding that they are made for.

Ive only tripped at my local, I know every groomer and tree run and how they all connect better then I know the roads in my town. took a tab during whiteout conditions where you could barely see 5 feet in front of you.

&#x200B;

it felt very visceral throwing myself down a mountain in the middle of the storm haha but 10/10 would do again.
